  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>These metal restraints can bind a Small or Medium creature. Escaping the handcuffs requires a successful DC 20 Dexterity check. Breaking them requires a successful DC 20 Strength check. Each set of handcuffs comes with one key. Without the key, a creature proficient with thieves' tools can pick the lock with a successful DC 15 Dexterity check. Handcuffs have 15 hit points. (Note: These are lighter weight manacles from D&amp;D.)</p>",
